erson","person_id":"hmj_pm8_38e","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-108-han:p014","chapter_id":"c-shiji-108-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m014-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"壺遂","kind":"person","person_id":"hmj_pm8_38e","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-108-han:p014","chapter_id":"c-shiji-108-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m009-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"壺遂","kind":"person","person_id":"hmj_pm8_38e","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m010-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"壺遂","kind":"person","person_id":"hmj_pm8_38e","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p010","chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji108-046","person_id":"hmj_pm8_38e","title":"詹事","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-108-han","source_id":"s-shiji-108-han","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-108-han:p014","quote":"太史公曰：余與壺遂定律暦，觀韓長孺之義，壺遂之深中隱厚。世之言梁多長者，不虛哉！壺遂官至詹事，天子方倚以爲漢相，會遂卒。不然，壺遂之內廉行修，斯鞠躬君子也。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji108-046:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-108-han:p014","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"詹事","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-108-han:m014-0007","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"記來源任官或用稱；未明年月及終止事件保持未知，篇末附載評論不作獨立任官證據。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji130-008","person_id":"hmj_pm8_38e","title":"上大夫","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p009","quote":"上大夫壺遂曰：「昔孔子何為而作春秋哉？」太史公曰：「余聞董生曰：『周道衰廢，孔子為魯司寇，諸侯害之，大夫壅之。孔子知言之不用，道之不行也，是非二百四十二年之中，以為天下儀表，貶天子，退諸侯，討大夫，以達王事而已矣。』子曰：『我欲載之空言，不如見之於行事之深切著明也。』夫春秋，上明三王之道，下辨人事之紀，別嫌疑，明是非，定猶豫，善善惡惡，賢賢賤不肖，存亡國，繼絕世，補敝起廢，王道之大者也。易著天地陰陽四時五行，故長於變；禮經紀人倫，故長於行；書記先王之事，故長於政；詩記山川谿谷禽獸草木牝牡雌雄，故長於風；樂樂所以立，故長於和；春秋辯是非，故長於治人。是故禮以節人，樂以發和，書以道事，詩以達意，易以道化，春秋以道義。撥亂世反之正，莫近於春秋。春秋文成數萬，其指數千。萬物之散聚皆在春秋。春秋之中，弒君三十六，亡國五十二，諸侯奔走不得保其社稷者不可勝數。察其所以，皆失其本已。故易曰『失之豪釐，差以千里』。故曰『臣弒君，子弒父，非一旦一夕之故也，其漸久矣』。故有國者不可以不知春秋，前有讒而弗見，後有賊而不知。為人臣者不可以不知春秋，守經事而不知其宜，遭變事而不知其權。為人君父而不通於春秋之義者，必蒙首惡之名。為人臣子而不通於春秋之義者，必陷篡弒之誅，死罪之名。其實皆以為善，為之不知其義，被之空言而不敢辭。夫不通禮義之旨，至於君不君，臣不臣，父不父，子不子。夫君不君則犯，臣不臣則誅，父不父則無道，子不子則不孝。此四行者，天下之大過也。以天下之大過予之，則受而弗敢辭。故春秋者，禮義之大宗也。夫禮禁未然之前，法施已然之後；法之所為用者易見，而禮之所為禁者難知。」"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji130-008:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p009","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"上大夫","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m009-0003","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"保存原文官爵用稱；授任與任期年月另待有證據的日期主張，不以卒年補任期終點。太史公依本段指司馬談，後段不據相同稱謂自動指同一人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji108-calendar-husui","person_ids":["hmj_pm8_38e"],"canonical_person_id":"hmj_pm8_38e","status":"contextual_provisional","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-108-han","c-shiji-130-taishigong"],"rationale":"108余與壺遂定律曆，130遷繼太史令後與上大夫壺遂論春秋；《漢書·律曆志》具名壺遂、太史令司馬遷等議造漢曆，與本篇共事者及130對話圈相合，暫定同人。上大夫、大中大夫與官至詹事保留各來源，不補授任順序或對話日期。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-108","chapter_id":"c-shiji-108-han","source_id":"s-shiji-108-han","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-108-han:p014","quote":"太史公曰：余與壺遂定律暦，觀韓長孺之義，壺遂之深中隱厚。世之言梁多長者，不虛哉！壺遂官至詹事，天子方倚以爲漢相，會遂卒。不然，壺遂之內廉行修，斯鞠躬君子也。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-108-han:m014-0007","c-shiji-108-han:m014-0020","c-shiji-108-han:m014-0040","c-shiji-108-han:m014-0057","c-shiji-108-han:m014-0063"]},{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-130","chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p009","quote":"上大夫壺遂曰：「昔孔子何為而作春秋哉？」太史公曰：「余聞董生曰：『周道衰廢，孔子為魯司寇，諸侯害之，大夫壅之。孔子知言之不用，道之不行也，是非二百四十二年之中，以為天下儀表，貶天子，退諸侯，討大夫，以達王事而已矣。』子曰：『我欲載之空言，不如見之於行事之深切著明也。』夫春秋，上明三王之道，下辨人事之紀，別嫌疑，明是非，定猶豫，善善惡惡，賢賢賤不肖，存亡國，繼絕世，補敝起廢，王道之大者也。易著天地陰陽四時五行，故長於變；禮經紀人倫，故長於行；書記先王之事，故長於政；詩記山川谿谷禽獸草木牝牡雌雄，故長於風；樂樂所以立，故長於和；春秋辯是非，故長於治人。是故禮以節人，樂以發和，書以道事，詩以達意，易以道化，春秋以道義。撥亂世反之正，莫近於春秋。春秋文成數萬，其指數千。萬物之散聚皆在春秋。春秋之中，弒君三十六，亡國五十二，諸侯奔走不得保其社稷者不可勝數。察其所以，皆失其本已。故易曰『失之豪釐，差以千里』。故曰『臣弒君，子弒父，非一旦一夕之故也，其漸久矣』。故有國者不可以不知春秋，前有讒而弗見，後有賊而不知。為人臣者不可以不知春秋，守經事而不知其宜，遭變事而不知其權。為人君父而不通於春秋之義者，必蒙首惡之名。為人臣子而不通於春秋之義者，必陷篡弒之誅，死罪之名。其實皆以為善，為之不知其義，被之空言而不敢辭。夫不通禮義之旨，至於君不君，臣不臣，父不父，子不子。夫君不君則犯，臣不臣則誅，父不父則無道，子不子則不孝。此四行者，天下之大過也。以天下之大過予之，則受而弗敢辭。故春秋者，禮義之大宗也。夫禮禁未然之前，法施已然之後；法之所為用者易見，而禮之所為禁者難知。」","mention_ids":["c-shiji-130-taishigong:m009-0003"]},{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-130","chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p010","quote":"壺遂曰：「孔子之時，上無明君，下不得任用，故作春秋，垂空文以斷禮義，當一王之法。今夫子上遇明天子，下得守職，萬事既具，咸各序其宜，夫子所論，欲以何明？」","mention_ids":["c-shiji-130-taishigong:m010-0000"]}],"references":[{"title":"《漢書·律曆志》壺遂與司馬遷議造漢曆","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%BC%A2%E6%9B%B8/%E5%8D%B7021&oldid=1373695","quote":"至武帝元封七年，漢興百二歲矣，大中大夫公孫卿、壺遂、太史令司馬遷等言「曆紀壞廢，宜改正朔」。","work_id":"w-hanshu","scope":"received_parallel_identity_and_calendar_event","text_layer":"received_dynastic_history","revision_id":1373695,"response_sha256":"48ca3f5e8be7330b9d4a57358a8226717039716ed8330590ab567a7cf99925c5","image_verified":false,"note":"核對固定版本數位正文，未核書影；ctext本頁未能讀取，不宣稱已作兩站對校。"}],"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false,"identity_materialized":true}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:p011","text":"安國爲人多大略，智足以當世取合，而出於忠厚焉。貪嗜於財。所推舉皆廉士，賢於己者也。於梁舉壺遂、臧固、郅他，皆天下名士，士亦以此稱慕之，唯天子以爲國器。安國爲御史大夫四歳餘，丞相田蚡死，安國行丞相事，奉引墮車蹇。天子議置相，欲用安國，使使視之，蹇甚，乃更以平棘侯薛澤爲丞相。安國病免數月，蹇愈，上復以安國爲中尉。歳餘，徙爲衞尉。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m011-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"安國","kind":"person","person_id":"6hy_i1z_hu2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m011-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"壺遂","kind":"person","person_id":"hmj_pm8_38e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m011-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"臧固","kind":"person","person_id":"z6u_kf1_554","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m011-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"郅他","kind":"person","person_id":"xqk_r2h_w1e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m011-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m011-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"安國","kind":"person","person_id":"6hy_i1z_hu2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m011-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"田蚡","kind":"person","person_id":"7mz_d13_9ka_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m011-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"安國","kind":"person","person_id":"6hy_i1z_hu2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m011-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m011-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"安國","kind":"person","person_id":"6hy_i1z_hu2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m011-0130","start":130,"end":132,"surface":"薛澤","kind":"person","person_id":"sqj_ztt_459","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m011-0136","start":136,"end":138,"surface":"安國","kind":"person","person_id":"6hy_i1z_hu2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m011-0146","start":146,"end":147,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m011-0149","start":149,"end":151,"surface":"安國","kind":"person","person_id":"6hy_i1z_hu2","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-108-han","book_id":"b-shiji-108","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-108-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:p014","text":"太史公曰：余與壺遂定律暦，觀韓長孺之義，壺遂之深中隱厚。世之言梁多長者，不虛哉！壺遂官至詹事，天子方倚以爲漢相，會遂卒。不然，壺遂之內廉行修，斯鞠躬君子也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m014-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m014-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"余","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m014-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"壺遂","kind":"person","person_id":"hmj_pm8_38e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m014-0014","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"韓長孺","kind":"person","person_id":"6hy_i1z_hu2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m014-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"壺遂","kind":"person","person_id":"hmj_pm8_38e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m014-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"壺遂","kind":"person","person_id":"hmj_pm8_38e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m014-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m014-0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"遂","kind":"person","person_id":"hmj_pm8_38e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m014-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"壺遂","kind":"person","person_id":"hmj_pm8_38e","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-108-han","book_id":"b-shiji-108","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-108-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p009","text":"上大夫壺遂曰：「昔孔子何為而作春秋哉？」太史公曰：「余聞董生曰：『周道衰廢，孔子為魯司寇，諸侯害之，大夫壅之。孔子知